    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18041" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτ-οψία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>seeing with one's own eyes,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				<u>Praef.</u>
				5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				286.20
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Syr.D.</u>
				1
			</span></i>; in Medic., as t.t. of the Empiric school, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				1.67
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τῆς αὐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					827
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>D</u>
				4
			</span></i> (Delph., <span class="entity">ii A. D.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1272.19
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὴν αὐ. ἐλθεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					9(1).61.17
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>supernatural manifestation, vision,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>in Alc.</u>
				p.92
			</span></i> C. (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				2.4
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				7.3
			</span></i> (pl.); [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαίμων] κληθεὶς εἰς αὐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Plot.</u>
					10
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Isid.</u>
				13
			</span></i> (pl.); opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνειρος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ps.-Callisth.
				1.6
			</span></i>; <i>magical operation</i> for the production of such a
			manifestation (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐθ.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Par.</u>
				1.950
			</span></i>, <i>P Mag.Leid.W.</i><i><span class="en">
				16.38
			</span></i>.</div>
